  82 00276 2023         ISZ NOTE        / Last note?
  83 00277 7410         SKP             / No, go get next
  84 00300 7402         HLT             / Yes, halt
  85 00301 5206         JMP START
  86                    *0376
  87 00376 7000 CDAM,   NOP
  88 00377 1041 DFIX,   TAD DAMP
